        "label": "Mr. Market's price ($)",
        "mode": "line",
        "datapoints": [
          { "label": "Q1", "value": 100, "sync": { "phrase": "one hundred" } },
          { "label": "Q2", "value": 142, "sync": { "phrase": "forty two" } },
          { "label": "Q3", "value": 78, "sync": { "phrase": "seventy eight" } },
          { "label": "Q4", "value": 115, "sync": { "phrase": "one fifteen" } }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "rules",
      "type": "list_card",
      "narration": "So when Mr. Market knocks, remember three simple rules. His price is only an offer. You can always ignore him. And his mood is never your problem.",
      "visual": {
        "title": "When he knocks",
        "items": [
          { "label": "Price is just an offer", "icon": "tick" },
          { "label": "You can ignore him", "icon": "box", "sync": { "phrase": "always ignore him" } },
          { "label": "His mood isn't yours", "icon": "arrow", "sync": { "phrase": "never your problem" } }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calm",
      "type": "character_scene",
      "narration": "The intelligent investor stays calm. He sits down with the business, studies the numbers, and lets the noise roll right past him.",
      "visual": {
        "title": "Do your homework",
        "elements": [
          {
            "kind": "figure",
            "id": "reader",
